VITE_TTS_API_URL=https://tts.yoread.com

## Dev (use local proxy): remove it from .env.development too; Vite proxy already points /api to localhost. Mobile APK (still use hosted TTS): create .env.mobile with: VITE_TTS_API_URL=https://tts.yoread.com Build with: vite build --mode mobile && npx cap copy android && cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
